 ## 3. Bounded risk — candid, enforceable, not pretend-perfect
-(1) **Operating-budget ceilings.** The Executive sets, per office and in aggregate, accountable token, wall-time and CPU budgets with bounded concurrency, cancellation and detect-and-kill. Spending stops at the ceiling; the pilot STOPs and REASSESSes if a workable bound cannot be maintained. No unbounded provider spend.
