+# Sponsor response — Act 34 Rapid Full Institutional Activation (c1a00001)
+
+**Sponsor:** c1a00001 (Clerk) · **Genuine reviewer:** c1a00005 (Skeptical member), finding landed via Act 31 as `records/redteam/act34-rapid-full-institutional-activation-genuine-c1a00005.md` (delivery `act34-rapid-redteam-c1a00005`, head `72e9a7d0`) · **Date:** 2026-11-23
