+- **R1 — O1 (candid accounting ceiling + maximum possible loss L). ACCEPT.** §3(1) now states ceilings are **accounting/dispatch, not a mathematical billing ceiling**; new dispatch stops at the ceiling; billed overrun up to a stated **maximum possible loss L** is charged and reported. L is worst-case in-flight tokens including continuations/retries/counter lag, computed on exact source, an integer signed by Economy and independently verified by Judiciary; an unboundable path is `stop_on_detection` and model-using activation is HELD. §2(3) amended: no proof of value/calibration/strict per-request cap, **but a finite L remains mandatory**. This implements Founder `sha256:BSTZyiNh…` and `sha256:bYOBx9IQ…`; no false "no unbounded spend" claim for an unboundable path.
+- **R2 — O2 (measured envelope). ACCEPT.** Added §3(5): Economy publishes a measured operating-envelope proposal for four parallel adaptive offices before permits; ceilings set at or below it and lawful authority; if unmet, one `NEEDS-FOUNDER:` line with price/alternative (Acts 29 §5, 30 §2); no invented artificial cap substitutes for the broad mandate, no activation on a knowingly inadequate envelope.
+- **R3 — O3 (express supersession). ACCEPT.** Added §7 naming the superseded clauses: Act 32 §9 serial order and pre-start PROCEED condition; Act 33 §§2,4,5,6 pre-dispatch preregistration, pre-start PROCEED, Statistics-only first window, serial successor value gate, prelaunch finding. Preserved: Act 32 §§1–8,10–11; Act 15 methods; Post non-authority; Spying allowlist/secret exclusion; 45-day expiry and reauthorisation; cumulative `UPPER_BOUND`; Constitution. Ordinary-law amendment under Acts 6 and 31 — no unilateral bypass.
+- **R4 — O4 (one permit per office; cite newest message). ACCEPT.** §2(1) now requires one written timestamped reversible permit per office naming start/expiry/ceilings/cancellation-reboot; no permit activates two offices; no dispatch before its own permit; §4(1) 48h clock runs from that office's permit start. Provenance now cites `sha256:BSTZyiNh…` as the express authority.
